							"documentation": "Entry: an authenticated Customer requests history. MemberView also calls the same TravelHistoryView method immediately after successful customer login in UC02.\nAuthorization: use the current user server LoginSession. A missing session or a role other than Customer stops retrieval before any data query.\nFailure: DataAccessError is distinct from a successfully returned empty list. Stop processing, show a lookup error and allow a new ViewPreviousTravelHistory() request or popup closure.\nDisplay: historyList contains the historical productName, travelPeriod, tourLevel and price. Close the popup or move to another view without cancelling the successful login.",
